			"notes": "\\+ Support for Minecraft 1.21.11\n\n### New features\n- [Freecam](https://github.com/Wurst-Imperium/WI-Freecam)\n- Inventory Buttons like NEU ones*\n- Auto Soulcry (thanks @loxchmorez)\n- Auto Close hoppity eggs GUI (thanks @loxchmorez)\n- Various rendering features such as: NoFog, NoFireOverlay, NoBlindness, NoDarkness, NoHurtCam (...and more)\n- Disable Lightning Bolts rendering\n- Show Invisible mobs such as Shadow Assassins, Fels and such (and an option to show EVERYTHING that's invisible)\n- Glowing to starred dungeons mobs\n- Auto Agaricus Cap for the Rift\n...and all the old features!\n\nHopefully in the future I also figure out a way to do opt-in automatic updates but since forced 1.21 drops tomorrow I figured I'd release the new client today. Have fun!\n\n*Giovanni blasts off at the speed of light!*"
		}
